    <div class="doc-grid">
      <a href="https://github.com/Dendro-X0/ship-studio/blob/main/docs/START-HERE.md">
        <strong>Start here</strong>
        <span>Boot order · publish spine · build</span>
      </a>
      <a href="https://github.com/Dendro-X0/ship-studio/blob/main/docs/product/SCOPE-OF-SERVICE.md">
        <strong>Scope of service</strong>
        <span>What Studio does and does not do</span>
      </a>
      <a href="https://github.com/Dendro-X0/ship-studio/blob/main/docs/product/PRODUCT.md">
        <strong>Product contract</strong>
        <span>Commands · surfaces · providers</span>
      </a>
      <a href="https://github.com/Dendro-X0/ship-studio/blob/main/docs/product/OPERATOR-NEXT.md">
